{"seq":3,"slug":"generics","title":"泛型与 TypeVar","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/type-system/generics","wordCount":1011,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"泛型与-typevar\">泛型与 TypeVar</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>泛型（Generics）允许函数和类在保持类型安全的前提下处理多种数据类型。Python 通过 <code>TypeVar</code> 定义类型变量，通过 <code>Generic</code> 基类构建泛型容器，从 Python 3.12 开始还支持更简洁的类型参数语法（PEP 695）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>泛型的核心是<strong>类型变量在一次使用中保持一致</strong>。以 <code>def identity(value: T) -&gt; T</code> 为例，传入 <code>42</code> 时 <code>T</code> 被绑定为 <code>int</code>，参数与返回值同时被约束为 <code>int</code>；这不同于 <code>Union[int, str]</code>——后者允许参数和返回值是不同类型。</p>\n<p>约束方式决定了类型变量能取哪些类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束方式</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无约束</td>\n<td><code>T = TypeVar(&quot;T&quot;)</code></td>\n<td>接受任意类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上界约束</td>\n<td><code>T = TypeVar(&quot;T&quot;, bound=Base)</code></td>\n<td>T 必须是 Base 或其子类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>值约束</td>\n<td><code>T = TypeVar(&quot;T&quot;, int, str)</code></td>\n<td>T 只能是列举的类型之一</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>另一个贯穿泛型系统的是<strong>变型</strong>（variance）：它决定 <code>Stack[Cat]</code> 能否当作 <code>Stack[Animal]</code> 使用。可读写容器保持不变，只读容器协变，消费者/回调逆变；变型声明错误会导致类型检查器拒绝本应合法的程序。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"typevar-基础\">TypeVar 基础</h2><h3 id=\"定义类型变量\">定义类型变量</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from typing import TypeVar&#10;&#10;T = TypeVar(&quot;T&quot;)&#10;&#10;def identity(value: T) -&gt; T:&#10;    return value&#10;&#10;result = identity(42)       # 推断为 int&#10;name = identity(&quot;Alice&quot;)    # 推断为 str\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TypeVar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">T </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TypeVar(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"T\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> identity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value: T) -> T:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> identity(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 推断为 int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> identity(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 推断为 str</span></span></code></pre></div><p>类型变量的核心语义是&quot;在一次调用中保持一致&quot;——当 <code>identity(42)</code> 被调用时，<code>T</code> 在该次调用中被绑定为 <code>int</code>，参数类型和返回类型同时被约束为 <code>int</code>。这与 <code>Union[int, str]</code> 不同，后者允许参数和返回值是不同类型。</p>\n<h3 id=\"约束与绑定\">约束与绑定</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无约束</td>\n<td><code>T = TypeVar(&quot;T&quot;)</code></td>\n<td>接受任意类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上界约束</td>\n<td><code>T = TypeVar(&quot;T&quot;, bound=Base)</code></td>\n<td>T 必须是 Base 或其子类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>值约束</td>\n<td><code>T = TypeVar(&quot;T&quot;, int, str)</code></td>\n<td>T 只能是 int 或 str</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from typing import TypeVar&#10;&#10;Number = TypeVar(&quot;Number&quot;, int, float)&#10;&#10;def add(a: Number, b: Number) -&gt; Number:&#10;    return a + b&#10;&#10;Comparable = TypeVar(&quot;Comparable&quot;, bound=&quot;SupportsLessThan&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TypeVar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TypeVar(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Number\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a: Number, b: Number) -> Number:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Comparable </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TypeVar(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Comparable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bound</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SupportsLessThan\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>上界约束（<code>bound</code>）和值约束的区别在于：<code>bound=Base</code> 表示 T 可以是 Base 的任何子类型，类型变量在使用时保留具体子类型信息；而值约束 <code>TypeVar(&quot;T&quot;, int, str)</code> 表示 T 只能是列举的类型之一，类型检查器会为每种可能性分别验证。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"泛型类\">泛型类</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from typing import TypeVar, Generic&#10;&#10;T = TypeVar(&quot;T&quot;)&#10;&#10;class Stack(Generic[T]):&#10;    def __init__(self) -&gt; None:&#10;        self._items: list[T] = []&#10;&#10;    def push(self, item: T) -&gt; None:&#10;        self._items.append(item)&#10;&#10;    def pop(self) -&gt; T:&#10;        return self._items.pop()&#10;&#10;    def peek(self) -&gt; T:&#10;        return self._items[-1]&#10;&#10;    def is_empty(self) -&gt; bool:&#10;        return len(self._items) == 0&#10;&#10;int_stack: Stack[int] = Stack()&#10;int_stack.push(1)&#10;int_stack.push(&quot;x&quot;)  # mypy 报错：str 不兼容 int\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TypeVar, Generic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">T </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TypeVar(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"T\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Stack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Generic[T]):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._items: list[T] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, item: T) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._items.append(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> T:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._items.pop()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> peek</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> T:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._items[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> is_empty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._items) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">int_stack: Stack[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Stack()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">int_stack.push(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">int_stack.push(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"x\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># mypy 报错：str 不兼容 int</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"python-3-12-新语法\">Python 3.12 新语法</h2><p>PEP 695 引入了更简洁的类型参数声明：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def identity[T](value: T) -&gt; T:&#10;    return value&#10;&#10;class Stack[T]:&#10;    def __init__(self) -&gt; None:&#10;        self._items: list[T] = []&#10;&#10;    def push(self, item: T) -&gt; None:&#10;        self._items.append(item)&#10;&#10;    def pop(self) -&gt; T:&#10;        return self._items.pop()&#10;&#10;type Vector[T] = list[T]&#10;type JSON = dict[str, &quot;JSON&quot;] | list[&quot;JSON&quot;] | str | int | float | bool | None\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> identity[T](value: T) </span><span style=\"color:#B31D28;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#FDAEB7;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Stack[T]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._items: list[T] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, item: T) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._items.append(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> T:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._items.pop()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Vector[T] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list[T]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dict[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JSON\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JSON\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"新旧语法对比\">新旧语法对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>旧语法（3.5+）</th>\n<th>新语法（3.12+）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型变量</td>\n<td><code>T = TypeVar(&quot;T&quot;)</code></td>\n<td>直接在 <code>[]</code> 中声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泛型类</td>\n<td><code>class C(Generic[T])</code></td>\n<td><code>class C[T]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泛型函数</td>\n<td>先定义 TypeVar，再使用</td>\n<td><code>def f[T](x: T) -&gt; T</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型别名</td>\n<td><code>TypeAlias = ...</code></td>\n<td><code>type Alias = ...</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上界</td>\n<td><code>TypeVar(&quot;T&quot;, bound=X)</code></td>\n<td><code>T: X</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"paramspec-与高阶函数\">ParamSpec 与高阶函数</h2><p><code>ParamSpec</code> 用于捕获函数的完整参数签名，是编写类型安全装饰器的关键工具。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from typing import ParamSpec, TypeVar, Callable&#10;from functools import wraps&#10;&#10;P = ParamSpec(&quot;P&quot;)&#10;R = TypeVar(&quot;R&quot;)&#10;&#10;def logged(func: Callable[P, R]) -&gt; Callable[P, R]:&#10;    @wraps(func)&#10;    def wrapper(*args: P.args, **kwargs: P.kwargs) -&gt; R:&#10;        print(f&quot;Calling {func.__name__}&quot;)&#10;        return func(*args, **kwargs)&#10;    return wrapper&#10;&#10;@logged&#10;def greet(name: str, times: int = 1) -&gt; str:&#10;    return f&quot;Hello, {name}! &quot; * times\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ParamSpec, TypeVar, Callable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> functools </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wraps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">P </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ParamSpec(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"P\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">R </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TypeVar(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"R\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> logged</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(func: Callable[P, R]) -> Callable[P, R]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @wraps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(func)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wrapper</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args: P.args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs: P.kwargs) -> R:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Calling </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">func.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__name__}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> func(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wrapper</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@logged</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, times: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Hello, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">! \"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> times</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ParamSpec 解决了 Python 类型系统中一个长期存在的痛点：在 ParamSpec 之前，装饰器要么丢失被装饰函数的签名信息（退化为 <code>Callable[..., Any]</code>），要么需要为每种参数组合编写重载。ParamSpec 让类型检查器能够&quot;穿透&quot;装饰器，保留原始函数的完整签名。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"typevartuple-可变泛型\">TypeVarTuple（可变泛型）</h2><p>Python 3.11 引入的 <code>TypeVarTuple</code> 支持可变数量的类型参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from typing import TypeVarTuple, Unpack&#10;&#10;Ts = TypeVarTuple(&quot;Ts&quot;)&#10;&#10;def zip_strict(*iterables: Unpack[tuple[*Ts]]) -&gt; list[tuple[*Ts]]:&#10;    ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TypeVarTuple, Unpack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TypeVarTuple(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> zip_strict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">iterables: Unpack[tuple[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Ts]]) -> list[tuple[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Ts]]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ...</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"协变与逆变\">协变与逆变</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>关键字</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不变</td>\n<td>默认</td>\n<td><code>Stack[Cat]</code> 不是 <code>Stack[Animal]</code></td>\n<td>可读写容器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协变</td>\n<td><code>covariant</code></td>\n<td><code>Seq[Cat]</code> 是 <code>Seq[Animal]</code> 的子类型</td>\n<td>只读容器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逆变</td>\n<td><code>contravariant</code></td>\n<td><code>Handler[Animal]</code> 是 <code>Handler[Cat]</code> 的子类型</td>\n<td>消费者 / 回调</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from typing import TypeVar, Generic&#10;&#10;T_co = TypeVar(&quot;T_co&quot;, covariant=True)&#10;&#10;class ReadOnlyList(Generic[T_co]):&#10;    def __init__(self, items: list[T_co]) -&gt; None:&#10;        self._items = items&#10;&#10;    def get(self, index: int) -&gt; T_co:&#10;        return self._items[index]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TypeVar, Generic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">T_co </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TypeVar(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"T_co\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">covariant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadOnlyList</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Generic[T_co]):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, items: list[T_co]) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._items </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, index: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> T_co:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._items[index]</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph BT&#10;  Cat --&gt; Animal&#10;  ReadOnlyList_Cat[ReadOnlyList[Cat]&quot;] --&gt; ReadOnlyList_Animal[ReadOnlyList[Animal]&quot;]\">graph BT\n  Cat --&gt; Animal\n  ReadOnlyList_Cat[ReadOnlyList[Cat]\"] --&gt; ReadOnlyList_Animal[ReadOnlyList[Animal]\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>简单场景用 <code>TypeVar</code>，装饰器场景用 <code>ParamSpec</code></li>\n<li>Python 3.12+ 项目优先使用新语法 <code>def f[T](x: T) -&gt; T</code></li>\n<li>为只读容器声明协变类型参数，避免不必要的类型不兼容</li>\n<li>避免过度泛型化——如果函数只用于 <code>str</code>，直接标注 <code>str</code> 即可</li>\n<li>使用 <code>bound</code> 约束而非多值约束来表达&quot;至少实现某接口&quot;的语义</li>\n<li>区分 <code>bound</code> 和值约束的适用场景：层级继承用 <code>bound</code>，枚举类型用值约束</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>泛型用类型变量在保持类型安全的前提下复用代码；<code>T</code> 在一次调用中被绑定，参数与返回值保持一致。</li>\n<li>三种约束：无约束、上界 <code>bound</code>（保留子类型信息）、值约束（限定为列举类型）。</li>\n<li>泛型类通过 <code>Generic[T]</code> 或 3.12 的 <code>class C[T]</code> 声明，旧代码在 <code>class C(Generic[T])</code> 与 <code>def f[T]</code> 两种写法间迁移。</li>\n<li><code>ParamSpec</code> 捕获完整参数签名，是类型安全装饰器的关键；<code>TypeVarTuple</code> 支持可变数量的类型参数。</li>\n<li>变型决定子类型关系：只读容器协变、消费者逆变、可读写容器不变。</li>\n<li>简单场景用 <code>TypeVar</code>，装饰器用 <code>ParamSpec</code>，并避免过度泛型化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"泛型与 TypeVar","id":"泛型与-typevar"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"TypeVar 基础","id":"typevar-基础"},{"level":3,"text":"定义类型变量","id":"定义类型变量"},{"level":3,"text":"约束与绑定","id":"约束与绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"泛型类","id":"泛型类"},{"level":2,"text":"Python 3.12 新语法","id":"python-3-12-新语法"},{"level":3,"text":"新旧语法对比","id":"新旧语法对比"},{"level":2,"text":"ParamSpec 与高阶函数","id":"paramspec-与高阶函数"},{"level":2,"text":"TypeVarTuple（可变泛型）","id":"typevartuple-可变泛型"},{"level":2,"text":"协变与逆变","id":"协变与逆变"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Protocol 与结构化子类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/type-system/protocols"},"next":{"title":"运行时类型检查与 Pydantic","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/type-system/runtime-validation"}}